    <string name="setup_learning_body">VoiceForm uses accessibility access to read interactive controls in the app you are using, then acts only after you ask. Voice transcription uses the speech recognition service configured on your device; recognized text is sent to your configured Core for command parsing. Nothing is recorded at install, and passive screen reading never activates the microphone.</string>
